## Monthly review

Every section is a heading, a paragraph and a chart, which is roughly a page of
print (SPEC 28). The harness repeats the body until the export reaches the length
SPEC 24.1 names.

```mdv line
title: Active accounts
x: month
y: accounts
series: tier
height: 360
---
month   | tier  | accounts
2024-01 | free  |      482
2024-01 | paid  |      414
2024-02 | free  |      530
2024-02 | paid  |      441
2024-03 | free  |      498
2024-03 | paid  |      470
2024-04 | free  |      640
2024-04 | paid  |      602
```
